{"page":91,"width":1880,"height":2357,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"과목 1 데이터 모일렁의 이해","words":[{"text":"과목","x":232,"y":95,"width":56,"height":29},{"text":"1","x":312,"y":95,"width":14,"height":28},{"text":"데이터","x":350,"y":93,"width":83,"height":29},{"text":"모일렁의","x":449,"y":93,"width":110,"height":29},{"text":"이해","x":577,"y":92,"width":53,"height":30}]},{"text":"제2절 관계와 조인의 이해","words":[{"text":"제2절","x":228,"y":236,"width":159,"height":57},{"text":"관계와","x":416,"y":235,"width":152,"height":56},{"text":"조인의","x":592,"y":234,"width":147,"height":56},{"text":"이해","x":770,"y":234,"width":95,"height":56}]},{"text":"관*는 사전적으로 정의하면 \u0027상호 연관성이 있는 상태\u0027라고 1과목 4절에서 정의하였다. 이는","words":[{"text":"관*는","x":261,"y":380,"width":298,"height":37},{"text":"사전적으로","x":572,"y":380,"width":145,"height":33},{"text":"정의하면","x":733,"y":380,"width":113,"height":33},{"text":"\u0027상호","x":860,"y":380,"width":65,"height":32},{"text":"연관성이","x":940,"y":378,"width":110,"height":33},{"text":"있는","x":1067,"y":378,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"상태\u0027라고","x":1136,"y":378,"width":120,"height":33},{"text":"1과목","x":1270,"y":378,"width":71,"height":32},{"text":"4절에서","x":1353,"y":378,"width":100,"height":32},{"text":"정의하였다.","x":1471,"y":378,"width":155,"height":32},{"text":"이는","x":1647,"y":377,"width":63,"height":31}]},{"text":"어떤 의미일까? 현상적으로 본다면, 관계를 맺는 것은 부모의 식별자를 자식에게 상속시기는 행위다. 이때 부모의","words":[{"text":"어떤","x":224,"y":431,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"의미일까?","x":295,"y":430,"width":129,"height":32},{"text":"현상적으로","x":437,"y":430,"width":146,"height":32},{"text":"본다면,","x":593,"y":431,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"관계를","x":702,"y":431,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"맺는","x":801,"y":432,"width":57,"height":30},{"text":"것은","x":870,"y":431,"width":56,"height":31},{"text":"부모의","x":937,"y":429,"width":82,"height":33},{"text":"식별자를","x":1035,"y":429,"width":112,"height":32},{"text":"자식에게","x":1157,"y":429,"width":111,"height":32},{"text":"상속시기는","x":1282,"y":428,"width":139,"height":33},{"text":"행위다.","x":1433,"y":429,"width":93,"height":32},{"text":"이때","x":1542,"y":428,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"부모의","x":1613,"y":427,"width":92,"height":32}]},{"text":"식별자를 자식의 식별자에 포함하면 식별관계, 부모의 식별자를 자식의 일반속성으로 상속하면 비식별관계라고","words":[{"text":"식별자를","x":225,"y":481,"width":117,"height":33},{"text":"자식의","x":355,"y":481,"width":86,"height":31},{"text":"식별자에","x":459,"y":480,"width":114,"height":32},{"text":"포함하면","x":588,"y":481,"width":115,"height":32},{"text":"식별관계,","x":720,"y":481,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"부모의","x":856,"y":480,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"식별자를","x":958,"y":479,"width":113,"height":33},{"text":"자식의","x":1084,"y":480,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"일반속성으로","x":1184,"y":479,"width":167,"height":33},{"text":"상속하면","x":1364,"y":478,"width":114,"height":33},{"text":"비식별관계라고","x":1494,"y":478,"width":215,"height":34}]},{"text":"하였다. 즉 관자를 맺는다는 건 식별자를 상속하괴 상속된 속성을 매핑기로 활용하여 데이터를 결함해 볼 수 있다는","words":[{"text":"하였다.","x":222,"y":532,"width":93,"height":32},{"text":"즉","x":328,"y":533,"width":31,"height":30},{"text":"관자를","x":368,"y":531,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"맺는다는","x":466,"y":531,"width":114,"height":32},{"text":"건","x":592,"y":532,"width":27,"height":31},{"text":"식별자를","x":632,"y":532,"width":112,"height":33},{"text":"상속하괴","x":755,"y":531,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"상속된","x":885,"y":531,"width":81,"height":32},{"text":"속성을","x":979,"y":530,"width":84,"height":33},{"text":"매핑기로","x":1074,"y":530,"width":109,"height":32},{"text":"활용하여","x":1193,"y":530,"width":109,"height":33},{"text":"데이터를","x":1317,"y":530,"width":107,"height":32},{"text":"결함해","x":1436,"y":530,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"볼","x":1531,"y":531,"width":31,"height":31},{"text":"수","x":1572,"y":531,"width":32,"height":30},{"text":"있다는","x":1616,"y":529,"width":93,"height":32}]},{"text":"의미다. 이를 따L에서는 조인(Join)이라 한다.","words":[{"text":"의미다.","x":221,"y":582,"width":97,"height":34},{"text":"이를","x":336,"y":582,"width":58,"height":31},{"te